invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_verify.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the host verifier compares x for a sum at infinity. Infinity's
  words are zeros, so X equals r times Z^2 for every r, and a
  signature whose two parts cancel verifies. bin/p384_equiv_test
  builds one for each of five keys and wants 0.

--- old
    if (p384_wide_point_is_infinity(&sum)) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
    (void)p384_wide_point_is_infinity(&sum);
